NOTE ON REUSE OF THE LAB DESIGNS

The experiments in LABS.md are offered specifically to be run, adapted, and
published — including results that contradict the framework they test. No
permission beyond attribution is required. Reporting a null or contradictory
result is the most valuable use of this material.

---

NOTE ON QUOTED MATERIAL

This repository quotes short excerpts from third-party documentation, academic
papers, and vendor security research for the purpose of analysis and criticism.
Those excerpts remain the property of their respective owners and are not
covered by the license above. Each is attributed at the point of use.
